  "name": "Glass Halo - fifth harmony tune",
  "created": "2026-10-16T00:00:00Z",
  "app": "0.2.0",
  "description": "Something new: crisp autotune (8 ms) on a CLEAR main voice, plus an invisible 'halo' choir - a quiet perfect-fifth harmony (+7) and a glassy octave-up shimmer (+12) that follow every note, a slow flanger glide through the halo, a dotted 1/8 ping-pong delay and a wide airy room. Main voice stays upfront and understandable; de-esser keeps the shine from hissing. Limiter at -1 dB.",
